 "admission_checked_at": "2026-11-19",
 "intro_zh": "景区由西湖和红花湖组成，素以五湖、六桥、八景而闻名，其山川秀邃、幽胜曲折、浮洲四起、青山似黛，古色古香的亭台楼阁隐现于树木葱茏之中，景域妙在天成，有“苎萝西子”之美誉，并有“大中国西湖三十六，唯惠州足并杭州”的史载。",
 "intro_en": "The scenic spot consists of West Lake and Honghua Lake. It is famous for its five lakes, six bridges and eight scenic spots. It has beautiful mountains and rivers, winding and winding mountains, floating islands everywhere, green mountains like black, and antique pavilions and pavilions hidden among the green trees. The scenery is so wonderful that it is known as \"The West Lake of Xizi\", and there is a historical record that \"there are thirty-six West Lakes in China, only Huizhou is equal to Hangzhou\".",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
